{"seq":3,"slug":"educational-technology","title":"教育技术","stage":"DONE","category":"education","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-technology","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 教育技术 简介\n\n教育技术是运用技术手段改善教育过程和提升学习效果的跨学科领域。从传统的视听教学媒体到现代的在线学习平台和AI辅导系统，技术正在深刻改变教育的形态和可能性。对于技术从业者而言，理解教育技术的理论基础和发展趋势，是开发优秀教育产品的关键。\n\n本知识库系统讲解教育技术的基础理论、在线学习模式和AI教育应用，面向教育科技从业者、学习产品设计师和对教育创新感兴趣的技术人员。\n\n第1章**教育技术基础**梳理教育技术的发展脉络，介绍学习设计与技术的结合以及数字素养的核心要素。\n\n第2章**在线学习**深入探讨在线学习的主要模式和平台设计，涵盖MOOC、在线课程平台和混合式学习的设计方法。\n\n第3章**AI教育应用**聚焦人工智能在教育领域的前沿应用，包括自适应学习系统、智能辅导和AI驱动的学习分析。\n\n建议读者从第1章建立教育技术的基础认知，再根据自身兴趣方向选择在线学习或AI教育应用深入学习。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"edtech-foundations","title":"教育技术基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-technology/edtech-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"edtech-evolution","title":"教育技术发展史","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-technology/edtech-foundations/edtech-evolution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"learning-design-technology","title":"学习设计与技术整合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-technology/edtech-foundations/learning-design-technology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-literacy","title":"数字素养与信息素养","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-technology/edtech-foundations/digital-literacy"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"online-learning","title":"在线学习","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-technology/online-learning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"online-learning-models","title":"在线学习模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-technology/online-learning/online-learning-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mooc-platform-design","title":"MOOC 与开放教育","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-technology/online-learning/mooc-platform-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"blended-learning","title":"混合式学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-technology/online-learning/blended-learning"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-in-education","title":"AI教育应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-technology/ai-in-education","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"adaptive-learning-systems","title":"自适应学习系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-technology/ai-in-education/adaptive-learning-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"intelligent-tutoring","title":"智能导学系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-technology/ai-in-education/intelligent-tutoring"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-assessment-analytics","title":"AI 教育评估与学习分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-technology/ai-in-education/ai-assessment-analytics"}]}]}